WEBVTT

c01
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.880 line:73%
Ano ba talaga ang ginagawa
ng solar panels mo?

c02
00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:06.000 line:73%
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

c03
00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:10.320 line:73%
Simple lang: liwanag ng
araw ang tumatama sa panels.

c04
00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:13.030 line:73%
Ginagawa itong DC na
kuryente ng solar cells.

c05
00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:16.530 line:73%
Pero AC ang gamit ng
appliances sa bahay.

c06
00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:21.040 line:73%
Kaya may inverter:
ginagawa nitong AC ang DC.

c07
00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:25.180 line:73%
Habang may araw, solar ang
tumutulong sa bahay mo.

c08
00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:29.590 line:73%
Kapag kulang o gabi na,
grid o battery ang sasalo.

c09
00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:35.920 line:73%
Panels, inverter, at tamang
setup. 'Yan ang solar!

cz1
00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:41.800 line:73%
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

cz2
00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:43.560 line:73%
Life is SoLight with Solar.
